'''Deathshund''' (ダッフンデッド, ''Daffundeddo'', '''Daffundead''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Dagshund]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3's [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and [[Zero Legends]]. It was added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]].

