==Trivia==
*Deathshund's Japanese name, Daffundead (ダッフンデッド ''Daffundeddo''), is derived from だっふんど ''Daffundo'' ([[Dagshund]]'s Japanese name) and ''undead''.
**Unlike Dagshund's Japanese name, Deathshund's is spelled in katakana rather than hiragana.
*Deathshund is the only Dagshund variant to appear outside of [[Event Stages]].

